    "intro_html":  "Arroz con pollo is the dish half of Latin America grew up on: chicken thighs simmered right into seasoned rice so every grain picks up the flavor. This batch packs \u003cstrong\u003e53 grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e and 628 calories per bowl for about \u003cstrong\u003e$4.01\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). Olives and peas at the end make it look fancier than the price tag admits.",
